<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41630" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιχειρο-τονέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sanction</i> or <i>confirm by vote,</i> of the
			Assembly, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπειδὰν ἐπιχειροτονῆτε τὰς γνώμας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					4.30
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ εἰρήνη ἡ
			ἐπιχειροτονηθεῖσα</span> Decr. ap. eund.<i><span class="en">
				18.29
			</span></i> ; incorrectly, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπεχειροτόνησεν ἡ
				βουλὴ καὶ ὁ δῆμος</span> Decr.ib.<i><span class="en">
				105
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>confirm in office,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς ἀρχάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Ath.</u>
					43.4
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				37.1
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς προέδρους -τονεῖν</span>
			the <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π.</span> shall <i>confirm</i> the
			appointment, Lexap.<i><span class="en">
				D.
				24.39
			</span></i> : hence, of a Roman Tribune, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπεχειροτόνησε τῷ Μαρίῳ τὴν στρατηγίαν</span>
			<i>got</i> the Praetorship for him, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Mar.</u>
				35
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
